    "text": "Rural Healthcare Access Improvement Act - This bill establishes grant programs to improve healthcare access in rural and underserved communities. The bill authorizes the Department of Health and Human Services to provide funding for telemedicine infrastructure, mobile health clinics, and recruitment of healthcare professionals to rural areas. The bill also includes provisions for expanding broadband access to support telehealth services.",
